

ITEMS to remove or keep
- If your goal is strictly to avoid redundancy and keep the pack lean, the Stirling engine and liquid burner features duplicate mechanics already addressed by Create Aeronautics and base Create.

If you are aiming for a minimalist mod list centered around Simulated and Aeronautics, you can safely drop the Stirling Engine mod. Simulated / Aeronautics already accounts for compact, fuel-based kinetic generation designed specifically to work cleanly on physics contraptions without needing extra multi-block setups.